"image": "engenn10le10ob09re2img01.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Well it's eight o'clock now.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: She will be here. I'm sure of it.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Just think, after tonight, you will have fallen in love.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: You think so?\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Peter if I were you, I wouldn't get my hopes up too high. If I go on a date, I usually lower my expectations. That way if the date goes bad, I won't be too disenchanted.\nWhen you have a big disappointment, you often get melancholy. I want you to protect yourself."}, {"time": "28000", "image": "engenn10le10ob09re2img02.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: It's cool. I have calibrated my expectations. If things go south, I will be fine.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Really? If Sally were here, she would be able to give you better advice.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: If Sally were here, she would have blogged about this as if it were a boxing match."}, {"time": "43800", "image": "engenn10le10ob09re2img05.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: True. Anyway, if it goes sideways, don't fret about it. By midnight tonight, this whole thing will have blown over.\nBy tomorrow, we will have forgotten all about it, and by Sunday we will have been laughing about it like it was a distant memory.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Or, by midnight tonight, SWEETGIRL and I will have been talking and carrying on for hours on end. By tomorrow, we will have completely fallen head over heels for each other and by Sunday, I will have been smiling ear to ear for about 48 hours straight.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Good luck Peter. If you need me, I'll be here.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: You're a good friend."}]}}], "title": "", "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}